<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Every match a registered, identified player finishes is written down. That covers matches against the computer and matches between two people in a P2P session. A guest's matches are played for fun and are not kept."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_star}>{dgettext("help_games", "How a game ranks")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "A versus game ranks wins. Hex Pong, Hex Tennis and Hex Hockey are versus games, like most of the others. A score game ranks the best score you took home, and tells you when you beat your own best. Hex Raid, Hex Invaders and Hex Enduro are score games. A co-op game ranks the score the two of you made together. Matches against the computer are ranked apart, with one ranking per difficulty."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_chart_bars}>{dgettext("help_games", "Ratings and challenges")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "Versus games also rank players by rating.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "A win against a stronger player gives more points.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "Each week has a new challenge for every game.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "The challenge starts on Monday.")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "The page of the game shows the challenge and its leader.")}</li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "Who is playing now")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_games", "The user list shows a game icon next to anybody who is playing now.")}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_protocol_p2p}>
  {dgettext("help_games", "After a match with somebody")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "The result appears in your private conversation as a card with the score and a way into the game's channel. While you play, the P2P entry of the conversation shows which game. Rematch, on the result inside the session, offers the same game again."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_games", "What does not count")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "A match somebody left before the end")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "A match that ended within seconds of starting")}</li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_games", "A score the game cannot produce")}</li>
</ul>

<p>
  {dgettext("help_games", "See also:")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-game-channels">{dgettext("help_games", "Game Channels")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="feature-retro-games">{dgettext("help_games", "Retro Games")}</.help_link>
</p>
